<title>USA: Effective Management in technology pact.</title>
<headline>Effective Management in technology pact.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Effective Management Systems Inc said Thursday it formed a strategic alliance and technology-sharing agreement with Indianapolis-based Pritsker Corp.</p>
<p>Pritsker is a supplier of manufacturing-scheduling technology and software.</p>
<p>Effective Management sells pre-integrated manufacturing software.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
